5425a59bc4af.webm?t=1770813953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600460/extras/db97b5e59488c1a743925425a59bc4af.mp4?t=1770813953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your characters with Dustwind's flexible system. Build specialists or generalists to match your tactical style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAP EDITOR &amp; WORKSHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600460/extras/575c6f576b6acc028dd071f0c9c1f5b9.poster.avif?t=1770813953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600460/extras/575c6f576b6acc028dd071f0c9c1f5b9.webm?t=1770813953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600460/extras/575c6f576b6acc028dd071f0c9c1f5b9.mp4?t=1770813953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own missions, stories, and multiplayer maps using the powerful map editor. Share your creations with the community through Steam Workshop.</p>",
      "short_description": "ARE YOU READY FOR CLASSIC REALTIME TACTICS? Be the nameless heroine in the wastelands of DUSTWIND's story campaign or find with two friends a new home or fight against and with human players in the elaborate Multiplayer mode or design your very own story campaigns and maps in the mighty map editor!",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian, Czech, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“Dog-filled tactics skirmisher Dustwind has been steadily chugging along for the last few years. Until now, it’s been content with being a modern multiplayer take on Fallout Tactics, offering up short scenarios to gun through solo or with pals. After two years, Dustwind Studios has brought the game even closer to its post-apocalyptics roots with an RPG-like story mode launched earlier today.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“The Fallout: Tactics Successor You Should Be Playing… Visually, DUSTWIND impressively mimics the look and feel of the Fallout Games to a ‘T’, even though the game runs in the Unity 3D Engine it’s the spitting image of the 2D games we all grew up with and loved.”<br>Indigo Gaming<br>",
